OL,3,ACalifornia probing whether China
OL,4,Aimproperly acquired Nvidia technology
OL,5,
OL,6,FCalifornia has served an investigative
OL,7,Fsubpoena on the AI chip designer Nvidia
OL,8,Fin the wake of a scandal that ended in
OL,9,Fthe departure of longtime CEO Jensen
OL,10,FHuang.
OL,12,FThe state's top law enforcement
OL,13,Fofficer, attorney general Rob Bonta,
OL,14,Fsaid he is probing whether Nvidia or
OL,15,FHuang's actions resulted in China
OL,16,Fobtaining advanced chips or
OL,17,Fconfidential information, adding that
OL,18,Fsuch actions could violate California
OL,19,Flaw if the company is found to have
OL,20,Fmislead investors and the public.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
